{"t": 1791920141.154, "event": "command", "who": "sam", "args": ["share", "18089", "--kind", "llama-server", "--limit", "4"], "exit": 0, "said": "Lent llama-server (port 18089) to everyone in your groups, up to 4 people at once.\nThey cannot open /slots, /v1/stream, /v1/streams, /v1/chat/completions/control, /lora-adapters, /metrics, /tools, /cors-proxy, /models: svrngs keeps these back whenever a llama-server is lent, since they show one person's use of it to the others or change it for everyone.\nsvrngs is running here already, so they can open it now.\n`svrngs unshare llama-server` stops lending it.\nIf llama-server takes a password on each request, paste what it takes in its Authorization header, then press Enter (Enter alone for none):"}
{"t": 1791920141.163, "event": "command", "who": "sam", "args": ["share", "18091", "--name", "night", "--kind", "night"], "exit": 0, "said": "Lent night (port 18091) to everyone in your groups, as many at once as want it. To let fewer in at once, change it on your home page, or `svrngs share 18091 --limit <number>`.\nsvrngs is running here already, so they can open it now.\n`svrngs unshare night` stops lending it.\nIf night takes a password on each request, paste what it takes in its Authorization header, then press Enter (Enter alone for none):"}
{"t": 1791920141.173, "event": "command", "who": "cy", "args": ["share", "18092", "--name", "taste", "--kind", "taste", "--ask", "the films you have marked"], "exit": 0, "said": "Lent taste (port 18092) to everyone in your groups, as many at once as want it. To let fewer in at once, change it on your home page, or `svrngs share 18092 --limit <number>`.\nAn app uses it only once the person it acts for says yes to: \"the films you have marked\".\nsvrngs is running here already, so they can open it now.\n`svrngs unshare taste` stops lending it.\nIf taste takes a password on each request, paste what it takes in its Authorization header, then press Enter (Enter alone for none):"}
